namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::Serializer::serialize_color(Color val)

\brief serialize a Color

Write a Color's RGBA values into the data stream. Also accepts a CSS color string or a packed RGBA number.

\warning the Color is written as a 24 (no alpha channel) or 32 bit color (with alpha channel). If you need to preserve greater color precision than this, you will need to serialize the components yourself.

\note data size: varies, call sizeof_color(Color) to determine

\sa sizeof_color(Color)
\sa Deserializer.deserialize_color()


**/ }